    {
      "target": "박물관에서 옛 국왕의 초상화를 봤어요.",
      "reading": "bakmulgwaneseo yeot gukwang-ui chosanghwareul bwasseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "I saw a portrait of a former king at the museum.",
